OL,3,GNEWSA'I gave my medals to my kidney
OL,4,Adonor'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA triathlete and former bodybuilder has
OL,7,Fsaid he sent his medals from the
OL,8,FBritish Transplant Games to the
OL,9,Fstranger whose donated kidney
OL,10,Ftransformed his life.
OL,12,FNathan Black, 58, from Burntwood, spent
OL,13,Fyears on dialysis after developing
OL,14,Frenal failure.
OL,16,FAfter a failed transplant from his
OL,17,Fmother, he received a kidney from an
OL,18,Fanonymous donor who he later came to
OL,19,Fknow as Paddy.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
